=== AMIR FF Information: ===
Hayato, a boy from a legendary Samurai family Being the only son of the family, Hayato is the only one who must continue with tradition and curse in turn...

This samurai has a secret that no one knows... That's why Hayato wishes his life to end as soon as possible.

Hayato had much on his shoulders as the eldest heir to the Yagami corporation.

He was raised in a life where his existence was meant to serve the honor and glory of his family.

When his family corporation was acquired by Horizon, he did not hesitate to get involved in corporate affairs to ensure that the Yagami continued to operate with honour.

